格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Open-source desktop AI agent workspace with one-click Claude Code, Codex, OpenClaw, Hermes Agent setup and custom LLM model routing.","id":"gh:1232030145","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"wesight","slug":"freestylefly/wesight","topics":["agent-skills","agent-workspace","ai-agent","ai-agents","claude-code","codex","deepseek-harness","desktop-app","dsh","dsh-plugin","electron","hermes-agent","llm","local-first","macos","model-router","openclaw","react","typescript","vibe-coding"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Open-source desktop AI agent workspace with one-click Claude Code, Codex, OpenClaw, Hermes Agent set"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"up and custom LLM model routing."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# WeSight"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Desktop AI Agent Workspace for Local Coding Agents"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"WeSight is an open-source desktop control console for local AI agents. It helps you install or reuse"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" Claude Code, Codex, Kimi Code, OpenClaw, Hermes Agent, OpenCode, Qwen Code, DeepSeek-TUI, and the b"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"uilt-in agent runtime, then gives them a visual workspace for chat, tools, files, IM channels, skill"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"s, model providers, runtime metrics, and desktop companion workflows."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> Public releases ship signed and notarized macOS builds for Apple Silicon and Intel, plus a Windows"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" x64 installer. If WeSight helps your agent workflow, a Star makes the project easier for more build"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"If WeSight helps your agent workflow, a Star makes the project easier for more builders to discover."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Quick Links"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Website: wesight.ai\n- Latest release: github.com/freestylefly/wesight/releases/latest\n- Screenshot"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"s: Screenshots\n- Core features: Core Features\n- Agent engines: Agent Engines\n- Product roadmap: Prod"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"uct Roadmap\n- Development: Quick Start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Why WeSight"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Terminal-native coding agents are powerful, while their setup, model routing, permissions, IM entry "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"points, file changes, and runtime metrics often live in separate places. WeSight turns those moving "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"pieces into one desktop workspace:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Install, detect, and reuse local agent CLIs from a beginner-friendly UI.\n- Run coding agents throu"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"gh a visual chat with tool panels, slash commands, file diffs, and permission prompts.\n- Connect age"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"nt tasks to IM channels such as Feishu, with per-engine configuration.\n- Track every task with engin"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"e, model, token usage, TTFT, TPS, tool latency, steps, status, and duration.\n- Extend workflows thro"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"ugh SkillHub skills, built-in skills, scheduled tasks, memory, and a desktop pet that follows active"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"illHub skills, built-in skills, scheduled tasks, memory, and a desktop pet that follows active work."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Cowork Chat\nRun local coding agents as a desktop chat with engine and model controls.\nAgent Engines\n"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"Configure Claude Code, Codex, Kimi Code, OpenClaw, Hermes Agent, OpenCode, Qwen Code, DeepSeek-TUI, "},{"id":"p13s3","text":"and the built-in runtime."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"AI Runtime Dashboard\nInspect engine, model, tokens, TTFT, output-phase TPS, estimated model TPS, cos"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"t, and status.\nLive Workspace\nWatch file writes, code changes, tool activity, and generated artifact"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"s while the agent works."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Skills Marketplace\nBrowse SkillHub categories, install skills locally, and manage installed skills f"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"rom WeSight.\nStudio & Pet\nUse a visual office-style workspace and desktop companion to follow active"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"Studio & Pet\nUse a visual office-style workspace and desktop companion to follow active agent tasks."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Core Features"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- **Agent Engines** - Run Claude Code, Codex, Kimi Code, OpenClaw, Hermes Agent, OpenCode, Qwen Code"},{"id":"p17s2","text":", DeepSeek-TUI, or the built-in runtime from the same workspace.\n- **One-click setup** - On macOS, W"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"eSight can install supported local CLIs or detect the ones already present on the machine.\n- **Unifi"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ed model providers** - Configure official OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Qwen, M"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"oonshot, Ollama, OpenRouter, GitHub Copilot, and custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints.\n- **Local CLI c"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"onfiguration** - Use existing Claude Code, Codex, Kimi Code, OpenClaw, Hermes Agent, OpenCode, Qwen "},{"id":"p17s7","text":"Code, or DeepSeek-TUI accounts and config when you already have a working terminal setup.\n- **Graphi"},{"id":"p17s8","text":"cal tool execution** - View commands, files, permissions, slash commands, outputs, generated images,"},{"id":"p17s9","text":" and tool results inside the chat flow.\n- **IM Agent Hub** - Route Feishu messages into OpenClaw, He"},{"id":"p17s10","text":"rmes Agent, Claude Code, or Codex, with per-engine bot profiles.\n- **AI Runtime Dashboard** - Measur"},{"id":"p17s11","text":"e calls by engine, model, source, status, tokens, completion time, TTFT, output-phase TPS, estimated"},{"id":"p17s12","text":" model TPS, tool latency, and agent steps.\n- **Live Workspace** - Open a right-side workspace for li"},{"id":"p17s13","text":"ve code writing, static diffs, runtime monitoring, task todos, skills, and artifacts.\n- **SkillHub M"},{"id":"p17s14","text":"arketplace** - Discover, categorize, install, enable, disable, update, and remove local WeSight skil"},{"id":"p17s15","text":"ls.\n- **Scheduled Tasks** - Create recurring agent jobs for research, reports, monitoring, inbox cle"},{"id":"p17s16","text":"anup, and reminders.\n- **Memory and personalization** - Extract useful preferences from conversation"},{"id":"p17s17","text":"s and reuse them across future sessions.\n- **Desktop pet and studio** - Keep a lightweight desktop c"},{"id":"p17s18","text":"ompanion and a pixel-style studio view for active tasks."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Agent Engines"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| Engine           | Best For                                                    | Setup Path       "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"                               |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Built-in runtime | General desktop cowork sessions and skills                  | Included in WeSig"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ht                             |\n| Claude Code      | Claude Code workflows with a graphical chat su"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"rface         | One-click install or existing local CLI config  |\n| Codex            | Codex CLI wor"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"kflows, local task execution, and IM control   | One-click install or existing local CLI config  |\n|"},{"id":"p20s5","text":" Kimi Code        | Kimi Code workflows with local login, Skills, and MCP       | Official installer"},{"id":"p20s6","text":" or existing local CLI config |\n| OpenClaw         | Runtime gateway, IM channels, sandbox-style age"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"nt work      | Local runtime/CLI reuse or WeSight setup flow   |\n| Hermes Agent     | Local Hermes A"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"gent gateway and IM-style runtime experiments | Official installer or existing local CLI config |\n| "},{"id":"p20s9","text":"OpenCode         | OpenCode terminal agent workflows                           | One-click install o"},{"id":"p20s10","text":"r existing local CLI config  |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Node.js `>=24 <25`\n- npm"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"WeSight uses Electron process isolation. The renderer never directly accesses Node.js APIs; privileg"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ed operations go through a typed preload bridge and IPC handlers in the main process."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Security Model"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Context isolation is enabled.\n- Node integration is disabled in the renderer.\n- Sensitive operatio"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ns run through main-process IPC.\n- Tool execution can surface permission requests before running.\n- "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"Local data is stored in SQLite under the app data directory.\n- Runtime folders, build artifacts, gen"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"erated assets, and local secrets are ignored by Git."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
